      "zh": {
        "title": "六起獨立航空事件彙整：樹木接觸、跑道事件、引擎問題及雷擊",
        "summary": "六起獨立航空事件分別涉及樹木接觸、跑道事件、引擎問題與雷擊。",
        "body": [
          "六起事件各自獨立，未有資料指出彼此相關。",
          "1. FAST Congo 的 L410 於2026年11月27日在 Dilolo 進場時接觸樹木。",
          "2. Fedex 的 MD-11（ICAO機型代碼MD11）於2026年11月25日在邁阿密著陸時衝出跑道。",
          "3. Delta 的空中巴士A321（ICAO機型代碼A321）於2026年11月26日在亞特蘭大發生引擎故障。",
          "4. Western Global 的波音747-400（ICAO機型代碼B744）於2026年11月25日在東京回滑時偏出跑道。",
          "5. France 的波音777-300（ICAO機型代碼B773）於2026年11月25日在巴黎附近出現引擎電子控制問題。",
          "6. THY 的波音737-800（ICAO機型代碼B738）於2026年11月25日在 Batumi 遭遇多次雷擊。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Roundup: Six independent aviation incidents span tree contact, runway, engine and lightning events",
        "summary": "Six independent aviation incidents involve tree contact, runway events, engine problems and lightning strikes.",
        "body": [
          "These six incidents are independent, with no stated relationship among them.",
          "1. FAST Congo’s L410 contacted trees on approach at Dilolo on November 27, 2026.",
          "2. Fedex’s MD-11 (ICAO type code MD11) overran the runway on landing at Miami on November 25, 2026.",
          "3. Delta’s Airbus A321 (ICAO type code A321) had an engine failure at Atlanta on November 26, 2026.",
          "4. Western Global’s Boeing 747-400 (ICAO type code B744) had a runway excursion while backtracking at Tokyo on November 25, 2026.",
          "5. France’s Boeing 777-300 (ICAO type code B773) had an engine electronic control problem near Paris on November 25, 2026.",
          "6. THY’s Boeing 737-800 (ICAO type code B738) experienced multiple lightning strikes at Batumi on November 25, 2026."
        ]
      },
